{
	"_comment": "Shared client/server parity fixture for institution IP range entries. Consumed by tests/unit-tests/content-gate/class-ip-access-rule.php (PHPUnit data provider over IP_Access_Rule::parse_ip_ranges()) and by src/wizards/audience/views/content-gates/institutions/utils.test.js (isValidEntry). Each case is a single entry — no commas — and `valid` means the server keeps it, i.e. it can grant access. Add new cases here rather than to one suite, so the two validators cannot drift without failing CI.",
	"cases": [
